<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 209 0 R
/E (The Role-Specific AI Voice Assistant Framework is a web-based platform that allows an organization to deploy one AI voice/chat assistant per functional role \(for example HR, IT Support, and Admissions\) without building a separate assistant from scratch for each department. A single underlying conversational engine is reused across roles; only the intents, sample utterances, workflow mappings, and integration endpoints differ per role profile.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
