/E (The primary objective of the system is to reduce the effort and cost of building and maintaining separate AI assistants for each organizational function by providing a single, configurable, role-aware voice assistant framework, thereby improving employee self-service, reducing repetitive query load on human staff, and enabling faster resolution of common role-specific requests.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [14]
>>
